{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c09b335a-a78b-81a9-a772-56dffeedf61e",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T12:46:09-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:43:42-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Monday, sort of. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:43:47-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Um, well, I'm calling about a parking ticket. It's my mother's, actually. She's got the car, but I'm the one dealing with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:43:55-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the issue with the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:43:58-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the meter was broken. She put in coins, quarters, a bunch of them, and nothing registered. The screen never moved off zero. And then she comes back out and there's a ticket on the windshield. Expired meter. It wasn't expired, it was broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:12-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:16-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yes, I do. Hang on. It's, uh, the number starts with a four, then, well, it's a long one. Do you need the whole thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:25-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not right now. I just need to know what you want to do. Are you looking to contest it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:31-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I want to appeal it. In writing. So where do I send that? Is there an address, or a person, or what? The ticket's got a lot of small print and none of it says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:42-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send it to the parking violations office here at City Hall, attention parking appeals. I can give you the mailing address. Got a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:50-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, yeah. I've got one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:44:53-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport City Hall, 43 Broadway, Newport, Rhode Island, 02840. Put the ticket number on the letter, plus the plate and the date. And say which meter it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:02-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 43 Broadway. Got it. Which meter, um, it's on the street by the library side. Is a photo okay? I took one of the meter, the screen was dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:12-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photo helps. Copy of the ticket too, don't send your original."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:16-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Well, the thing is, I'd have gone out and looked at it again but the rain Friday and Saturday, two days ago, the whole street was a mess, and anyway, I can't take it up with the meter itself, can I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:29-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the meter's not going to hear your case. The letter's the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:34-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Um, and it's not like she can call the meter people. Honestly, I'd rather be fixing my own stuff. The man next door to me is always working on the same old truck, every weekend, and I can't even get a quiet hour to write this letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:49-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like that truck's never getting done. Anything else on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:53-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's it. Does the fine keep going up while they decide?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:45:58-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put the appeal in on time and it's usually held while it's reviewed. Check the deadline on the ticket itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:46:05-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:46:07-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
